mapRenderTy * S;\n  mapCanvasEl.style.transform =\n    'translate(' + TX.toFixed(2) + 'px,' + TY.toFixed(2) + 'px) scale(' + S.toFixed(5) + ')';\n  positionMapCard();\n  updateMapScaleBar();\n  if(commit === false) return;\n  if(Math.abs(Math.log(S)) > MAP_COMMIT_LOG || Math.abs(TX) > MAP_COMMIT_PX || Math.abs(TY) > MAP_COMMIT_PX)\n    scheduleMapNodes();\n}\n\n// —— 比例尺：取一个能填满 ~92px 的整数距离（1/2/5 × 10^n）——\n// 右上角的 m/px 说的是「底图有多细」，比例尺说的是「这段路有多远」，两件事。\nfunction updateMapScaleBar(){\n  var bar = document.getElementById('th-map-scale-bar'), txt = document.getElementById('th-map-scale-txt');\n  if(!bar || !txt || !mapSheet || !mapFit) return;\n  var mpp = mapMppHere();\n  if(!(mpp > 0)){ bar.style.width = '0'; txt.textContent = ''; return; }\n  var raw = mpp * 110;\n  var pow = Math.pow(10, Math.floor(Math.log(raw) / Math.LN10));\n  var n = raw / pow;\n  var meters = (n >= 5 ? 5 : n >= 2 ? 2 : 1) * pow;\n  bar.style.width = (meters / mpp).toFixed(1) + 'px';\n  txt.textContent = meters >= 1000 ? +(meters / 1000).toFixed(meters % 1000 ? 1 : 0) + ' km'\n                  : meters >= 1     ? Math.round(meters) + ' m'\n                                    : meters.toFixed(1) + ' m';\n}\n\n// —— van Wijk 2003《Smooth and efficient zooming and panning》——\n// 谷歌地图 / Mapbox 的 flyTo 走的就是这条弧线：远距离跳转先拉远、平移、再推近，\n// 全程「视觉速度」恒定，所以既不会中途晕，也不会近处慢、远处飞。\n// 起终点很近时公式自动退化成纯缩放，不用另写一支。\nfunction mapZoomInterpolator(p0, p1){\n  var rho = 1.42, rho2 = rho * rho, rho4 = rho2 * rho2;\n  var ux0 = p0[0], uy0 = p0[1], w0 = p0[2];\n  var ux1 = p1[0], uy1 = p1[1], w1 = p1[2];\n  var dx = ux1 - ux0, dy = uy1 - uy0, d2 = dx * dx + dy * dy, S, fn;\n  if(d2 < 1e-9 || !isFinite(d2)){\n    S = Math.abs(Math.log(w1 / w0)) / rho;\n    fn = function(t){ return [ux0 + t * dx, uy0 + t * dy, w0 * Math.pow(w1 / w0, t)]; };\n  } else {\n    var d1 = Math.sqrt(d2);\n    var b0 = (w1 * w1 - w0 * w0 + rho4 * d2) / (2 * w0 * rho2 * d1);\n    var b1 = (w1 * w1 - w0 * w0 - rho4 * d2) / (2 * w1 * rho2 * d1);\n    var r0 = Math.log(Math.sqrt(b0 * b0 + 1) - b0);\n    var r1 = Math.log(Math.sqrt(b1 * b1 + 1) - b1);\n    S = (r1 - r0) / rho;\n    fn = function(t){\n      var s = t * S, ch0 = Math.cosh(r0);\n      var u = w0 / (rho2 * d1) * (ch0 * Math.tanh(rho * s + r0) - Math.sinh(r0));\n      // u 已是整段位移的比例，直接乘坐标差即可到达目标。\n      return [ux0 + u * dx, uy0 + u * dy, w0 * ch0 / Math.cosh(rho * s + r0)];\n    };\n  }\n  if(!isFinite(S) || S < 0) S = 0;\n  fn.S = S;\n  return fn;\n}\n\nvar mapAnim = null, mapAnimRaf = 0, mapAnimGuard = 0;\nfunction cancelMapCamera(){\n  if(mapAnimRaf) cancelAnimationFrame(mapAnimRaf);\n  if(mapAnimGuard) panelClearDelay(mapAnimGuard);\n  mapAnimRaf = 0; mapAnimGuard = 0; mapAnim = null;\n  mapViewportEl.classList.remove('th-flying');\n}\n// 目标用「视野中心的世界坐标 + 倍率」描述，而不是 tx/ty：\n// 中途落地重排会改 mapRenderTx/Ty，中心点和倍率却不受影响，算式不会漂。\nfunction mapCameraTo(cx, cy, k, opt){\n  if(!mapProj || !mapSheet) return;\n  opt = opt || {};\n  k = Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(cx, cy, k), k));\n  cancelMapCamera(); cancelMapGlide(); cancelMapZoom();\n  var landed = function(){\n    mapK = k; mapTx = mapProj.vw / 2 - cx * k; mapTy = mapProj.vh / 2 - cy * k;\n    applyMapTransform(false); renderMapNodes();\n    if(opt.done) opt.done();\n  };\n  var w0 = mapProj.vw / mapK, w1 = mapProj.vw / k;\n  var from = [(mapProj.vw / 2 - mapTx) / mapK, (mapProj.vh / 2 - mapTy) / mapK, w0];\n  var moved = Math.hypot(from[0] - cx, from[1] - cy) * mapK;\n  if(mapReduceMotion || opt.instant || (moved < 1.5 && Math.abs(Math.log(w1 / w0)) < 0.004)){ landed(); return; }\n  var itp = mapZoomInterpolator(from, [cx, cy, w1]);\n  var dur = opt.duration || Math.max(300, Math.min(1250, itp.S * 760));\n  mapAnim = {itp:itp, dur:dur, t0:mapNow(), land:landed};\n  mapViewportEl.classList.add('th-flying');\n  // rAF 在后台标签页 / 内嵌 webview 里可能被节流甚至完全不触发。\n  // 兜底定时器保证镜头一定会落到目标，不会永远停在半空。\n  mapAnimGuard = panelDelay(function(){ if(mapAnim){ var f = mapAnim.land; cancelMapCamera(); f(); } }, dur + 320);\n  mapAnimRaf = requestAnimationFrame(mapCameraTick);\n}\nfunction mapCameraTick(){\n  mapAnimRaf = 0;\n  if(!mapAnim || !mapProj) return;\n  var t = Math.min(1, (mapNow() - mapAnim.t0) / mapAnim.dur);\n  // 弧线本身已是等视觉速度，只在首尾各补一点缓动，起步收尾不生硬\n  var e = t < 0.5 ? 4 * t * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 3) / 2;\n  var p = mapAnim.itp(e);\n  mapK = Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(p[0], p[1], mapProj.vw / p[2]), mapProj.vw / p[2]));\n  mapTx = mapProj.vw / 2 - p[0] * mapK;\n  mapTy = mapProj.vh / 2 - p[1] * mapK;\n  if(t >= 1){ var f = mapAnim.land; cancelMapCamera(); f(); return; }\n  applyMapTransform(false);\n  // 飞行途中也要落地几次：镜头拉远时标记会被 transform 挤成一团，\n  // 而目的地那一片在落地之前完全是空的\n  var S = mapK / mapRenderK;\n  if(Math.abs(Math.log(S)) > 0.5 ||\n     Math.abs(mapTx - mapRenderTx * S) > mapProj.vw * 0.85 ||\n     Math.abs(mapTy - mapRenderTy * S) > mapProj.vh * 0.85) renderMapNodes();\n  mapAnimRaf = requestAnimationFrame(mapCameraTick);\n}\n\n// —— 惯性：松手后按指数衰减继续滑一段，就是谷歌地图「甩一下」的手感 ——\nvar mapVel = {x:0, y:0}, mapVelT = 0, mapGlideRaf = 0;\nfunction cancelMapGlide(){ if(mapGlideRaf) cancelAnimationFrame(mapGlideRaf); mapGlideRaf = 0; }\nfunction mapStartGlide(){\n  cancelMapGlide();\n  if(mapReduceMotion){ renderMapNodes(); return; }\n  // 松手前手指已经停住了，就不该再滑\n  if(mapNow() - mapVelT > 90){ renderMapNodes(); return; }\n  var vx = mapVel.x, vy = mapVel.y, sp = Math.hypot(vx, vy);\n  if(sp < 0.14){ renderMapNodes(); return; }        // px/ms\n  var cap = 3.4;                                     // 上限，防止暴力甩动直接飞出图幅\n  if(sp > cap){ vx *= cap / sp; vy *= cap / sp; }\n  var last = mapNow();\n  function step(){\n    var t = mapNow(), dt = Math.min(48, t - last);\n    // 首帧 dt 可能是 0，这时位移当然也是 0 —— 别把它误判成「撞到边界」\n    if(dt <= 0){ mapGlideRaf = requestAnimationFrame(step); return; }\n    last = t;\n    var decay = Math.pow(0.0026, dt / 1000);         // 1 秒衰减到 0.26%\n    var bx = mapTx, by = mapTy;\n    mapTx += vx * dt; mapTy += vy * dt;\n    vx *= decay; vy *= decay;\n    applyMapTransform();\n    // 撞到图幅边界后位置不再变化，继续空转没意义\n    var stuck = Math.abs(mapTx - bx) < 0.05 && Math.abs(mapTy - by) < 0.05;\n    if(stuck || Math.hypot(vx, vy) < 0.02){ cancelMapGlide(); renderMapNodes(); return; }\n    mapGlideRaf = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n  mapGlideRaf = requestAnimationFrame(step);\n}\n\n// —— 平滑缩放：滚轮 / 按钮 / 双击都走这里，锚点在整个补间过程中钉住不动 ——\nvar mapZoomAnim = null, mapZoomRaf = 0, mapZoomGuard = 0;\nfunction cancelMapZoom(){\n  if(mapZoomRaf) cancelAnimationFrame(mapZoomRaf);\n  if(mapZoomGuard) panelClearDelay(mapZoomGuard);\n  mapZoomRaf = 0; mapZoomGuard = 0; mapZoomAnim = null;\n}\nfunction mapZoomLand(){\n  var a = mapZoomAnim;\n  cancelMapZoom();\n  if(a){\n    mapK = Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(a.wx, a.wy, a.to, a.ax, a.ay), a.to));\n    mapTx = a.ax - a.wx * mapK; mapTy = a.ay - a.wy * mapK;\n    applyMapTransform(false);\n  }\n  renderMapNodes();\n}\n// 求出 CSS cubic-bezier(.25,.1,.25,1) 对应的进度；先解横坐标，再取纵坐标。\nfunction mapZoomEase(t){\n  var u = t;\n  for(var i = 0; i < 6; i++) u -= (u * (.75 + u * (-.75 + u)) - t) / (.75 + u * (-1.5 + 3 * u));\n  return u * (.3 + u * (2.4 - 1.7 * u));\n}\nfunction mapZoomTick(){\n  mapZoomRaf = 0;\n  var a = mapZoomAnim;\n  if(!a) return;\n  var t = Math.min(1, (mapNow() - a.t0) / 220);\n  if(mapReduceMotion || t >= 1){ mapZoomLand(); return; }\n  // 按实际时间推进，刷新率不会改变时长；对数倍率让放大和缩小的速度对称。\n  var nk = Math.exp(Math.log(a.from) + (Math.log(a.to) - Math.log(a.from)) * mapZoomEase(t));\n  mapK = Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(a.wx, a.wy, nk, a.ax, a.ay), nk));\n  mapTx = a.ax - a.wx * mapK; mapTy = a.ay - a.wy * mapK;\n  applyMapTransform();\n  mapZoomRaf = requestAnimationFrame(mapZoomTick);\n}\n// 进幅。focus 给了就把那个点位居中，否则铺满。\n// 跨幅时世界坐标系本身换了（mapSheetProject 重算 mapFit），镜头插值没有意义，\n// 所以改成「先拉远一点落地、再推到位」：新图幅从略大的尺寸洗入，\n// 和谷歌地图切到另一片区域时的观感一致。\nfunction enterMapSheet(id, focusIdx, k, noAnim, opt){\n  var sh = mapSheetById(id);\n  if(!sh || !mapProj) return;\n  opt = opt || {};\n  if(opt.seamless){\n    var ll = mapWorldToLL((mapProj.vw/2-mapTx)/mapK,(mapProj.vh/2-mapTy)/mapK);\n    var scale = mapFit.s * mapK;\n    mapSheet = sh; mapSheetProject(); mapK = scale / mapFit.s;\n    var w = mapLLToWorld(ll[0],ll[1]);\n    mapTx = mapProj.vw/2-w[0]*mapK; mapTy = mapProj.vh/2-w[1]*mapK;\n    renderMapSheetChip();\n    if(mapLayersEl && mapLayersEl.classList.contains('open')) renderMapLayersPanel();\n    return;\n  }\n  mapRelayAt = mapNow();\n  cancelMapCamera(); cancelMapGlide(); cancelMapZoom();\n  var sameSheet = mapSheet && mapSheet.id === sh.id;\n  mapSheet = sh;\n  if(mapRegionOf(sh)) mapRegion = mapRegionOf(sh);   // 飞到别的地区的点时，地图册跟着换地区（补丁 17）\n  mapSheetProject();\n  var fit = mapFitK();\n  var fl0 = mapFloor(sh);\n  var focused = focusIdx != null && focusIdx >= 0 && mapWorld[focusIdx];\n  var toK = focused ? mapFlyK(k, mapWorld[focusIdx].wx, mapWorld[focusIdx].wy)\n                    : Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(fl0.px / 2, fl0.pxh / 2, k || fit), k || fit));\n  var fl = mapFloor(sh);\n  var cx = focused ? mapWorld[focusIdx].wx : fl.px / 2;\n  var cy = focused ? mapWorld[focusIdx].wy : fl.pxh / 2;\n  if(focused){   // 和 flyToMapPoint 一样，点落在侧栏 / 抽屉没挡住的那块正中\n    var fc = mapFreeCenter();\n    cx -= (fc.x - mapProj.vw / 2) / toK;\n    cy -= (fc.y - mapProj.vh / 2) / toK;\n  }\n  var anim = !noAnim && !mapReduceMotion;\n  mapK = anim ? Math.max(mapMinK(), toK * 0.82) : toK;\n  mapTx = mapProj.vw / 2 - cx * mapK;\n  mapTy = mapProj.vh / 2 - cy * mapK;\n  mapRenderTx = mapTx; mapRenderTy = mapTy; mapRenderK = mapK;\n  mapPrevMarkerKeys = null;          // 换了一片地，所有点位都算新出现\n  applyMapTransform(false);\n  renderMapNodes();\n  renderMapSheetChip();\n  if(!sameSheet) mapPlaySheetIn();\n  if(anim) mapCameraTo(cx, cy, toK, {duration:520});\n  if(mapLayersEl && mapLayersEl.classList.contains('open')) renderMapLayersPanel();\n}\n// 换幅时底图层做一次呼吸，盖住新图解码前的那一瞬空白\nfunction mapPlaySheetIn(){\n  var root = mapCanvasEl.querySelector('.th-map-basemaps');\n  if(!root || mapReduceMotion) return;\n  root.classList.remove('sheet-in');\n  void root.offsetWidth;\n  root.classList.add('sheet-in');\n  panelDelay(function(){ root.classList.remove('sheet-in'); }, 520);\n}\n\n// 缩放锚点：光标下的那块图，缩放前后停在光标原处。\n// 缩放上限检查锚点对应的目标视口。\nfunction zoomMapAt(newK, ax, ay, instant){\n  if(!mapProj || !mapSheet) return;\n  var wx = (ax - mapTx) / mapK, wy = (ay - mapTy) / mapK;\n  // 连续滚轮沿用同一个锚点，再按这个锚点检查覆盖范围。\n  if(!instant && !mapReduceMotion && mapZoomAnim && Math.abs(mapZoomAnim.ax - ax) < 26 && Math.abs(mapZoomAnim.ay - ay) < 26){\n    wx = mapZoomAnim.wx; wy = mapZoomAnim.wy; ax = mapZoomAnim.ax; ay = mapZoomAnim.ay;\n  }\n  newK = Math.max(mapMinK(), Math.min(mapCeilK(wx, wy, newK, ax, ay), newK));\n  cancelMapCamera(); cancelMapGlide();\n  if(instant || mapReduceMotion){\n    cancelMapZoom();\n    if(Math.abs(newK - mapK) < 1e-9) return;\n    mapK = newK; mapTx = ax - wx * mapK; mapTy = ay - wy * mapK;\n    applyMapTransform(false); renderMapNodes();\n    return;\n  }\n  if(Math.abs(newK - mapK) < 1e-9 && !mapZoomAnim) return;\n  mapZoomAnim = {ax:ax, ay:ay, wx:wx, wy:wy, from:mapK, to:newK, t0:mapNow()};\n  if(mapZoomGuard) panelClearDelay(mapZoomGuard);\n  mapZoomGuard = panelDelay(mapZoomLand, 500);   // rAF 被节流时兜底\n  if(!mapZoomRaf) mapZoomRaf = requestAnimationFrame(mapZoomTick);\n}\n\n// 铁道 / 河流的手绘矢量。原来带 minK/maxK 按倍率显隐——那是旧的全局倍率标尺，\n// 图幅制下 mapK 的含义变成了「图片缩放比」，那两个阈值失去意义，改成按图幅判断。\n// ===== 点位海拔（国土地理院 DEM5A / 10B，2020-12-31 基准）=====\n// MyGO 的剧情符号里坂道占了很重的分量，千登世桥 30.1m、桥下面影桥 9.5m，\n// 20 米落差就是目白台崖线本身。步行耗时按爬升加时间，卡片上也直接写出来。\nvar mapElev = 面板静态.mapElev;\n// ===== 铁道线路与车站（国土数值情报 N02，2020 年度）=====\n// 22 条线 294 座车站。折线做过 RDP 12m 简化：6666 顶点 → 1168。\n// 这份取代了原来手绘的两条 MAP_ROUTES —— 真实线形比手描的准得多。\nvar mapRail = 面板静态.mapRail;\n\n\n// 底图数据来源署名：OSM 是 ODbL，必须署名；Natural Earth 是公有领域\nvar MAP_ATTRIBUTION = '© OpenStreetMap contributors · 2020';\nvar MAP_ATTRIBUTION_URL = 'https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright';\n// 图层开关（右下角面板）\nvar mapLayers = {basemap:true, areas:false, routes:true, mark