"><span data-qq-avatar-text>讯</span><img data-qq-avatar-img alt=\"\" hidden></button><div class=\"pct-qqme\"><strong data-qq-name>LiPhone</strong><small><span class=\"pct-online\">在线</span> · <span data-contact-count>0</span> 项 · 本存档独立</small></div></div></header><div class=\"pct-appbody pct-commbody\"><section class=\"pct-comm-list\" data-comm-list><div class=\"li-seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"联系人\"><button type=\"button\" data-li-seg=\"roster\" aria-pressed=\"true\">名单</button><button type=\"button\" data-li-seg=\"added\" aria-pressed=\"false\">已加<b data-li-added>0</b></button><button type=\"button\" data-li-seg=\"entries\" aria-pressed=\"false\">条目</button></div><div class=\"pct-search pct-qqsearch\"><input data-comm-search aria-label=\"搜索联系人或群聊\" placeholder=\"搜索联系人、群聊\"></div><div class=\"li-roster\" data-li-roster></div><div class=\"pct-contact-list\" data-comm-contacts></div><div class=\"pct-post-list\" data-comm-posts hidden></div><div class=\"pct-section-title\" data-comm-recent-head><strong>正文出场提示</strong><button data-comm-scan>扫描正文</button></div><div class=\"pct-recent\" data-comm-recent><div class=\"pct-empty\">扫描结果只定位条目，不会自动建立联系人。</div></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"comm\" aria-live=\"polite\">在“NPC来源”里手动选择人物条目后绑定。</div></section><section class=\"pct-source-dialog\" data-comm-source-dialog role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"NPC来源\" hidden><button class=\"pct-source-dismiss\" data-comm-source-close aria-label=\"关闭NPC来源\"></button><div class=\"pct-source-sheet\"><header class=\"pct-source-head\"><h3>NPC来源</h3><button class=\"pct-source-close\" data-comm-source-close aria-label=\"关闭NPC来源\">×</button></header><div class=\"pct-card pct-sourcebox\"><div class=\"pct-fields\"><label>来源世界书<select data-comm-source-wb></select></label><div class=\"pct-scope-card\"><span>主世界书 · 当前存档投影</span><strong data-comm-save-wb>正在准备…</strong><small data-archive-state>读取当前存档身份中…</small></div></div><div class=\"pct-entry-tools\"><div class=\"pct-card\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-npc-identify>识别 NPC 并加入联系人</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pct-btn\" data-npc-identify-stop hidden>取消识别</button><p class=\"pct-source-note\">使用当前模型扫描本书并自动加入联系人，会消耗模型额度。只识别启用条目的主要人物；跳过已有联系人、背景绑定和通讯记录。长条目读取前 6000 字，多人合集请手动绑定。AI 可能漏认或误认，完成后请核对联系人。</p><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"npc-identify\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div><div class=\"pct-qqsearch pct-picker-search\"><input data-comm-entry-search aria-label=\"搜索来源条目\" placeholder=\"搜索\"><b class=\"pct-picker-people\">👥</b></div><label class=\"pct-picker-hidden\"><select class=\"pct-entry-select\" data-comm-source-entry aria-label=\"人物条目\" size=\"6\" multiple></select></label><div class=\"pct-picker-head\"><span>全部条目</span><span class=\"pct-picker-count\" data-picker-count>0 条</span></div><div class=\"pct-pick-list\" data-entry-pick-list aria-label=\"点选条目\"></div><div class=\"pct-entry-preview\" data-entry-preview>请选择一个或多个世界书条目。单选用于绑定私聊，多选（2 人以上）用于建立群聊。</div><div class=\"pct-picker-foot\"><label>联系人名称<input data-comm-npc-name aria-label=\"联系人名称\" placeholder=\"选择条目后确认名称\"></label><label>群聊名称<input data-comm-group-name aria-label=\"群聊名称\" placeholder=\"多选 2 人以上时填写群名\"></label><div class=\"pct-picker-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-comm-bind disabled>绑定并私聊</button><button class=\"pct-btn blue\" data-comm-group disabled>建立群聊</button></div></div><div class=\"pct-card\"><h3>背景设定词条</h3><p class=\"pct-source-note\">从上方列表选择世界观、地区或规则条目，再设为背景。AI 在私聊、群聊和主动消息中读取，但不会将它作为联系人或群成员发言。选择随当前存档保存，每次生成读取最新内容；合计最多 24000 字。</p><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-background-add>将所选词条设为背景</button><div data-background-list></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"background\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div><small class=\"pct-source-note\">群聊：按住 Ctrl/⌘（手机端长按）多选条目，至少 2 人。群里每条消息都会发给全部成员，每位成员在回复时都能看到其他成员已经说过的话。</small></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pct-source-dialog\" data-comm-members-dialog role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"群聊成员\" hidden><button class=\"pct-source-dismiss\" data-comm-members-close aria-label=\"关闭群聊成员\"></button><div class=\"pct-source-sheet\"><header class=\"pct-source-head\"><h3>群聊成员</h3><button class=\"pct-source-close\" data-comm-members-close aria-label=\"关闭群聊成员\">×</button></header><div class=\"pct-card pct-sourcebox\"><div class=\"pct-scope-card\"><span>当前群聊</span><strong data-members-group>—</strong><small data-members-count>—</small></div><div class=\"pct-member-list\" data-members-list></div><label>从哪本世界书挑<select data-members-wb></select></label><label>添加成员（可多选；手机端点条目即可）<select class=\"pct-entry-select\" data-members-add-select size=\"5\" multiple></select></label><div class=\"pct-qqsearch pct-dialog-search\"><input data-members-search aria-label=\"搜索可选条目\" placeholder=\"搜索成员词条\"></div><div class=\"pct-pick-list\" data-members-pick-list aria-label=\"点选成员\"></div><label>群内名字（选中 1 个条目＝给 TA 起名；不选条目＝直接新建一个只有名字的成员）<input data-members-add-name maxlength=\"24\" placeholder=\"例如：路人甲\"></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn blue\" data-members-add>加入群聊</button><button class=\"pct-btn ghost\" data-members-refresh>刷新可选条目</button></div><small class=\"pct-source-note\">每位成员的名字都能直接改：改上面的输入框，再点「改名」；旧名字会留作关键词，正文里提到旧名字也照样触发这个群聊。移出成员不会删除他在群里的发言记录，重新加入后仍然可见。群聊至少保留 1 位成员；想清空整个群请用「解散」。<br>「退群」＝让 TA 主动退出（群里提示「已退出群聊」，可留一句话）；「移出」＝被移出（提示「已被移出群聊」）。</small><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"members\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pct-thread\" data-comm-thread hidden><header class=\"pct-thread-head\"><button data-comm-thread-back aria-label=\"返回联系人\">‹</button><button class=\"pct-avatar large\" type=\"button\" data-thread-avatar aria-label=\"更换头像\"><span data-thread-avatar-text>讯</span><img data-thread-avatar-img alt=\"\" hidden></button><div class=\"pct-thread-name\"><strong data-thread-name>未选择联系人</strong><small data-thread-source>来源未载入</small></div><span class=\"pct-thread-tags\"><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-comm-proactive>主动</button><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-comm-summarize hidden>总结</button><span class=\"pct-badge\" data-thread-badge>私聊</span><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-comm-members hidden>成员</button><button class=\"pct-head-action danger\" type=\"button\" data-comm-contact-delete hidden>删除</button><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-comm-group-disband hidden>解散</button></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"li-round\" data-li-more aria-label=\"更多\" aria-expanded=\"false\"></button></header><div class=\"li-more-mask\" data-li-more-mask></div><div class=\"pct-messages\" data-comm-messages><div class=\"pct-empty\">暂无通讯记录。</div></div><div class=\"pct-composer\"><div class=\"pct-composer-head\" data-composer-head><span class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"thread\" aria-live=\"polite\">不会写入正文输入框。</span></div><div class=\"pct-summary-hint\" data-summary-hint hidden><span>消息有点多了，可以总结旧消息让上下文更轻。</span><button type=\"button\" data-comm-summarize-hint>总结</button></div><div class=\"pct-speak-fab\" data-speak-fab hidden><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-speak-toggle>本次发言 · 全员</button></div><div class=\"pct-speak-bar\" data-speak-bar hidden><span class=\"pct-speak-label\">本次发言</span><div class=\"pct-speak-chips\" data-speak-chips></div><small class=\"pct-speak-hint\" data-speak-hint>未选＝全员回复</small><button class=\"pct-stop\" type=\"button\" data-comm-stop hidden>停止回复</button></div><div class=\"pct-compose-row\"><textarea data-comm-input aria-label=\"私聊消息\" placeholder=\"输入消息…\"></textarea><button class=\"pct-send\" data-comm-generate aria-label=\"生成 NPC 回复\">➤</button></div><div class=\"pct-private-note\">通讯记录仅属于当前存档</div></div></section><section class=\"pct-thread\" data-comm-post hidden><header class=\"pct-thread-head\"><button data-post-back aria-label=\"返回广场\">‹</button><button class=\"pct-avatar large\" type=\"button\" data-post-avatar aria-label=\"帖子头像\"><span data-post-avatar-text>吐</span><img data-post-avatar-img alt=\"\" hidden></button><div class=\"pct-thread-name\"><strong data-post-title>吐槽帖</strong><small data-post-sub>—</small></div><span class=\"pct-thread-tags\"><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-post-reveal hidden>揭穿</button><button class=\"pct-head-action danger\" type=\"button\" data-post-delete>删除</button></span></header><div class=\"pct-messages\" data-post-messages></div><button class=\"pct-post-fab\" type=\"button\" data-post-fab hidden><span class=\"pct-fab-ico\">💬</span><span data-post-fab-label>写评论 / 让 TA 评论</span></button><div class=\"pct-composer pct-post-sheet\" data-post-composer><button class=\"pct-composer-grab\" type=\"button\" data-post-collapse aria-label=\"收起评论面板\"></button><div class=\"pct-composer-head\" data-post-composer-head><div class=\"pct-reply-hint\" data-post-reply-hint hidden></div><span class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"post\" aria-live=\"polite\">选几位角色来评论。</span></div><div class=\"pct-speak-bar\"><span class=\"pct-speak-label\">评论者</span><div class=\"pct-speak-chips\" data-post-chips></div><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-post-reply-cancel hidden>取消回复</button><small class=\"pct-speak-hint\" data-post-hint-note>未选＝没有评论者</small><button class=\"pct-head-action\" type=\"button\" data-post-cast-add>＋ 选词条</button><button class=\"pct-anon-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-post-anon-toggle aria-pressed=\"true\">匿名评论</button></div><div class=\"pct-post-manual\"><label>以谁的身份发<select data-post-say-who></select></label><div class=\"pct-compose-row\"><textarea data-post-input rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"自己写评论或回复\" placeholder=\"自己写一条评论或回复…\"></textarea><button class=\"pct-send\" data-post-send aria-label=\"发送\">➤</button></div></div><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-post-comment>让 TA 评论</button></div><div class=\"pct-private-note\">帖子与评论只属于当前存档</div></div></section></div></section><section class=\"pct-source-dialog\" data-post-dialog role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"发一条吐槽\" hidden><button class=\"pct-source-dismiss\" data-post-close aria-label=\"关闭发帖\"></button><div class=\"pct-source-sheet\"><header class=\"pct-source-head\"><h3>发一条吐槽</h3><button class=\"pct-source-close\" data-post-close aria-label=\"关闭发帖\">×</button></header><div class=\"pct-card pct-sourcebox\"><label>从哪本世界书挑<select data-post-author-wb></select></label><div class=\"pct-qqsearch pct-dialog-search\"><input data-post-author-search aria-label=\"搜索发帖人词条\" placeholder=\"搜索词条\"></div><div class=\"pct-picker-head\"><span>发帖人</span><span class=\"pct-picker-count\" data-post-picker-count>0 位</span></div><div class=\"pct-pick-list\" data-post-author-list></div><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input data-post-anon type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>匿名发帖（显示成「匿名1」，记录里保留真实身份）</span></label><label>帖子正文（留空＝让模型按最近正文生成）<textarea data-post-manual-text rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"想自己写就直接写在这里\"></textarea></label><label>发帖人名字（选中词条后自动填，可改）<input data-post-author-name maxlength=\"24\" placeholder=\"默认用词条名 / 我\"></label><label>想吐槽什么（可留空，交给模型按最近正文发挥）<input data-post-hint maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"例如：今天又被拉去唱 K\"></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-post-create>生成帖子</button></div><small class=\"pct-source-note\">帖子按最近正文生成，写进这条帖子自己的世界书投影条目；匿名帖用「吐槽 / 树洞 / 帖子 / 匿名」等关键词触发，不会写真实姓名。真实身份保存在本存档记录里，之后可以用「揭穿」公开。</small><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"post-sheet\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pct-source-dialog\" data-post-cast-dialog role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"选择评论者\" hidden><button class=\"pct-source-dismiss\" data-post-cast-close aria-label=\"关闭评论者名单\"></button><div class=\"pct-source-sheet\"><header class=\"pct-source-head\"><h3>评论者名单</h3><button class=\"pct-source-close\" data-post-cast-close aria-label=\"关闭评论者名单\">×</button></header><div class=\"pct-card pct-sourcebox\"><p class=\"pct-source-note\">从世界书挑一个词条当评论者，可以自己改名字；词条内容会作为 TA 的资料带进提示词，这样评论不会跑偏。</p><label>从哪本世界书挑<select data-post-cast-wb></select></label><div class=\"pct-qqsearch pct-dialog-search\"><input data-post-cast-search aria-label=\"搜索词条\" placeholder=\"搜索词条\"></div><div class=\"pct-picker-head\"><span>可选词条</span><span class=\"pct-picker-count\" data-post-cast-count>0 条</span></div><div class=\"pct-pick-list\" data-post-cast-list></div><label>名字（可改）<input data-post-cast-name maxlength=\"24\" placeholder=\"默认用词条名\"></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-post-cast-ok>加入名单</button><button class=\"pct-btn ghost\" data-post-cast-del>从名单移除所选</button></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"post-cast\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pct-modal\" data-pct-modal role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"pct-modal-title\" hidden><div class=\"pct-modal-mask\" data-modal-cancel></div><div class=\"pct-modal-box\"><h3 class=\"pct-modal-title\" id=\"pct-modal-title\" data-modal-title>提示</h3><p class=\"pct-modal-text\" data-modal-text></p><div class=\"pct-modal-field\" data-modal-field hidden></div><div class=\"pct-modal-actions\" data-modal-actions></div></div></section><input type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" data-avatar-file hidden><section class=\"pct-app\" data-app=\"settings\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert><header class=\"pct-apphead\"><button data-route=\"comm\">返回消息</button><h2>设置</h2></header><div class=\"pct-settings-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"设置分类\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pct-tab-connection\" aria-controls=\"pct-panel-connection\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" data-settings-tab=\"connection\">连接</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pct-tab-prompts\" aria-controls=\"pct-panel-prompts\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-settings-tab=\"prompts\">提示词</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pct-tab-archive\" aria-controls=\"pct-panel-archive\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-settings-tab=\"archive\">存档</button></div><div class=\"pct-appbody\"><section role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pct-panel-connection\" aria-labelledby=\"pct-tab-connection\" data-settings-panel=\"connection\"><p class=\"pct-settings-intro\">选一套熟悉的配置，开始新的对话。</p><div class=\"pct-hero\"><div class=\"pct-hero-copy\"><span class=\"pct-hero-label\">当前连接</span><strong data-hero-mode>当前酒馆连接</strong><small data-hero-model>跟随酒馆的模型与参数</small></div><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" type=\"button\" data-setting-models>拉取模型</button></div><details class=\"pct-group\"><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">我的模型方案</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"profiles\">尚未保存</span></summary><label>设定名称<input data-profile-name placeholder=\"例如：日常聊天 / 长文模型\"></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-profile-save>保存当前模型设定</button></div><label>已保存的模型设定<select data-profile-list><option value=\"\">尚无已保存设定</option></select></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-profile-apply>切换所选设定</button><button class=\"pct-btn ghost\" data-profile-delete>删除所选设定</button></div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>了解详情</summary><small class=\"pct-security-note\">保存调用方式、URL、模型、接口源、温度与最大回复长度。方案存入本插件，可随助手导出脚本的数据携带；Key 单独保存在本设备或当前会话，切换方案时一并切换，不随插件导出。“当前酒馆连接”始终跟随酒馆当前连接。</small></details><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"profile\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></details><details class=\"pct-group\" open><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">调用方式与模型</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"connection\">当前酒馆连接</span></summary><label>调用方式<select data-setting-mode><option value=\"st\">当前酒馆连接</option><option value=\"custom\">独立 URL + Key</option></select></label><div class=\"pct-fields\"><label>模型<input data-setting-model list=\"pct-models\" placeholder=\"模型名\"><datalist id=\"pct-models\"></datalist></label><label>选择已拉取模型<select data-model-choice disabled><option value=\"\">请先拉取模型</option></select></label></div><details class=\"pct-sub\"><summary>独立连接的 URL、接口源与 API Key</summary><label>API URL<input data-setting-url placeholder=\"https://example.com/v1\"></label><label>接口源<select data-setting-source><option value=\"openai\">OpenAI 兼容</option><option value=\"custom\">酒馆 Custom</option></select></label><label>API Key<input data-setting-key type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"填写后可保存在本设备\"></label><div class=\"pct-key-options\"><label class=\"pct-check\"><input data-setting-remember-key type=\"checkbox\"><span>在本设备记住 API Key</span></label><button class=\"pct-key-clear\" type=\"button\" data-setting-clear-key>清除已保存 Key</button></div><small class=\"pct-security-note\">本地保存为明文，仅限当前酒馆网址下的这台设备；绝不会写入聊天变量、数据库、世界书或插件导出文件。</small></details></details><details class=\"pct-group\" open><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">生成参数</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"params\">温度 0.90 · 上限 900 tokens</span></summary><label>温度<div class=\"pct-range-row\"><input data-temp-comm-range type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\"><input data-temp-comm-number type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\"></div></label><div class=\"pct-fields\"><label>最大输出 tokens<input data-setting-max-tokens type=\"number\" min=\"128\" max=\"8192\" step=\"64\"></label><label>正文读取楼层<input data-setting-scan-depth type=\"number\" min=\"2\" max=\"30\" step=\"1\"></label><label>主动消息读取正文<input data-setting-active-depth type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\"></label></div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>了解详情</summary><small class=\"pct-security-note\">「正文读取楼层」用于私聊参考最近几层正文；「主动消息」最多读取最近 8 层正文，据此让 NPC 主动发一条消息。</small></details></details></section><section role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pct-panel-prompts\" aria-labelledby=\"pct-tab-prompts\" data-settings-panel=\"prompts\" hidden><p class=\"pct-settings-intro\">决定角色如何说话，以及哪些设定参与对话。</p><details class=\"pct-group\" open><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">接入酒馆预设词条</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"preset\">未开启</span></summary><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-preset-enabled><span>启用预设词条接入</span></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-preset-refresh>刷新当前预设</button><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-preset-select-enabled>勾选酒馆已启用词条</button><button class=\"pct-btn ghost\" data-preset-clear>清空勾选</button></div><div class=\"pct-list\" data-preset-list></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"preset\" aria-live=\"polite\">尚未读取。</div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>使用说明</summary><p class=\"pct-security-note\">读取当前聊天补全预设，独立勾选用于私聊、群聊与主动消息；不会改变酒馆里的词条开关。按预设列表顺序与原角色，放在终端系统提示之后、任务上下文之前。正文历史等占位项不接入，也不复刻正文插入深度。酒馆宏按当前角色卡处理。勾选按预设分别保存在本浏览器，生成时读取最新内容；切换到未配置的预设后请重新勾选。正文生成仍使用酒馆原设置。</p></details></details><details class=\"pct-group\" open><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">自定义系统提示（破限 / 风格）</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"custom\">未启用</span></summary><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input data-setting-custom-enabled type=\"checkbox\"><span>启用自定义系统提示</span></label><label>拼接位置<select data-setting-custom-position><option value=\"after\">放在插件提示词之后（覆盖力更强）</option><option value=\"before\">放在插件提示词之前（定基调）</option></select></label><textarea data-setting-custom-prompt rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"把你的破限 / 风格提示词粘贴到这里……\"></textarea><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-custom-import>从文件导入</button><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-custom-export>导出为文件</button><button class=\"pct-btn ghost\" data-custom-clear>清空</button><input type=\"file\" accept=\".txt,.md,.json,text/plain\" data-custom-file hidden></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"custom\" aria-live=\"polite\">未启用。</div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>使用说明</summary><p class=\"pct-security-note\">把你自己的提示词粘贴或导入进来，每次私聊 / 群聊 / 主动消息生成时都会带上它。只保存在<b>本设备浏览器</b>里，不会写入存档、世界书或导出的插件文件。</p></details></details></section><section role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pct-panel-archive\" aria-labelledby=\"pct-tab-archive\" data-settings-panel=\"archive\" hidden><p class=\"pct-settings-intro\">管理自动消息、存档同步与通讯记录。</p><details class=\"pct-group\" data-setting-group=\"summary\"><summary><span>消息总结</span><span data-setting-value=\"summary\" class=\"pct-group-value\">已开启提示</span></summary><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input data-setting-summary-hint type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>消息较多时在输入框上方提示「点这里总结」</span></label><small class=\"pct-security-note\">只提示，不会自动调用模型。</small><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input data-setting-summary-auto type=\"checkbox\"><span>每新增 100 条消息自动更新摘要，全部消息保留（会消耗一次模型调用）</span></label><small class=\"pct-security-note\">默认关闭。开启后只更新摘要，不删除原消息；已有开启设置仍按此规则工作。首次达到 100 条及之后每新增 100 条时总结一次。</small><label class=\"pct-field\">总结时跳过最近 <input data-setting-summary-keep type=\"number\" min=\"5\" max=\"80\" step=\"5\" value=\"20\"> 条消息</label></details><div class=\"pct-card pct-card-compact\"><label class=\"pct-check pct-switch\"><input data-setting-auto-proactive type=\"checkbox\"><span>每条正文后，让相关 NPC 自动发一条消息</span></label><small class=\"pct-security-note\">默认关闭。开启后每当正文出现新的一层，只有「这一层里被提到的已绑定联系人」会自动来消息（最多 1 位）；每次额外消耗一次模型调用，群聊不会自动触发。</small></div><details class=\"pct-group\"><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">世界书注入方式</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"inject\">严格按存档 · 深度 2</span></summary><label>注入方式<select data-setting-inject-mode><option value=\"scope\">严格按存档注入（推荐）</option><option value=\"entry\">世界书条目开关</option></select></label><div class=\"pct-fields\"><label>注入深度<input data-setting-inject-depth type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\"></label><label>注入角色<select data-setting-inject-role><option value=\"system\">system</option><option value=\"user\">user</option><option value=\"assistant\">assistant</option></select></label></div><label>其他存档的条目<select data-setting-foreign-entries><option value=\"remove\">随存档迁移（只保留当前存档，推荐）</option><option value=\"keep\">保留并隔离（多标签同时玩时用）</option></select></label><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>了解详情</summary><small class=\"pct-security-note\">严格模式：投影条目一律保持停用，只作为「这个存档的通讯记录」存在；每次生成正文前，由终端按当前存档挑选命中的联系人与群聊内容直接注入，他档内容不会串进来。切回「条目开关」则回到旧行为（用条目启用状态控制）。严格模式依赖酒馆助手的 injectPrompts 能力，缺失时会自动退回条目开关并提示。注入深度/角色用于和别的注入类扩展错开位置（默认深度 2、system）。<br>「随存档迁移」：世界书里只保留当前存档的通讯条目——切到新存档就是 0 条，切回旧存档会从该存档的数据里自动重建（数据本来存在各自的存档里，不会丢）。多标签/多客户端同时开不同存档时会互相删，此时改用「保留并隔离」。</small></details></details><details class=\"pct-group\"><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">通讯记录 导入 / 导出</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"store\">—</span></summary><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-export-store>导出本存档</button><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-import-store>导入并合并</button><input type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\" data-import-file hidden></div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"archive\" aria-live=\"polite\">尚未导出。</div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>使用说明</summary><p class=\"pct-security-note\">导出当前存档的全部联系人与群聊为 JSON；导入按消息指纹去重合并，不会覆盖或清空现有记录。换设备、换卡、备份时用得上。</p></details></details><details class=\"pct-group\"><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">世界书投影修复</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"repair\">高级</span></summary><label class=\"pct-check\"><input data-repair-purge-foreign type=\"checkbox\"><span>同时清理其他存档的投影条目</span></label><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-repair-scan>扫描重复条目</button><button class=\"pct-btn danger\" data-repair-run disabled>备份并合并</button><button class=\"pct-btn danger\" data-repair-purge-all>清理并暂停本书投影</button><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-repair-resume>恢复本书投影同步</button></div><div class=\"pct-repair-summary\" data-repair-summary>尚未扫描。普通同步已停止新增重复条目；这里用于清理旧版本留下的副本。</div><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"repair\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><details class=\"pct-help\"><summary>使用说明</summary><p class=\"pct-security-note\">只扫描当前主世界书中带有通讯终端严格签名的条目。修复前会自动建立一份未绑定的完整备份世界书；无法确认归属的条目不会删除。默认保留其他存档的投影条目：它们只在各自存档被打开时启用注入。</p></details></details><details class=\"pct-group\"><summary><span class=\"pct-group-title\">运行时能力</span><span class=\"pct-group-value\" data-group-value=\"capabilities\">未检测</span></summary><div class=\"pct-capabilities\" data-capabilities>尚未检测。</div><div class=\"pct-actions\"><button class=\"pct-btn\" data-setting-check>检测能力</button></div></details></section><footer class=\"pct-settings-footer\"><button class=\"pct-btn primary\" data-setting-save>保存设置</button><div class=\"pct-status\" data-status=\"settings\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></footer></section><nav class=\"pct-nav\" aria-label=\"LiPhone 导航\"><button type=\"button\" data-comm-filter=\"all\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"pct-nav-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.5 11.6c0 4-3.8 7.2-8.5 7.2-1 0-2-.15-2.9-.43L5 20l1.3-3.6A6.9 6.9 0 0 1 3.5 11.6c0-4 3.8-7.2 8.5-7.2s8.5 3.2 8.5 7.2Z\"/></svg></span><em>消息</em><i class=\"pct-nav-badge\" data-nav-badge=\"unread\" hidden></i></button><button type=\"button\" data-comm-filter=\"contact\" aria-current=\"false\"><span class=\"pct-nav-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.4\" r=\"3.6\"/><path d=\"M5.4 19.6c1.2-3.3 3.7-4.9 6.6-4.9s5.4 1.6 6.6 4.9\"/></svg></span><em>联系人</em></button><button type=\"button\" data-comm-filter=\"group\" aria-current=\"false\"><span class=\"pct-nav-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9.4\" cy=\"9\" r=\"3.2\"/><path d=\"M3.4 19.4c1-2.9 3.3-4.4 6-4.4s5 1.5 6 4.4\"/><path d=\"M16.2 6.5a2.9 2.9 0 0 1 0 5.4\"/><path d=\"M17.4 14.7c1.9.5 3.2 2 3.8 4.3\"/></svg></span><em>群聊</em></button><button type=\"button\" data-comm-filter=\"post\" aria-current=\"false\"><span class=\"pct-nav-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4.2 6.6h15.6v9.2H9.4L5.6 19v-3.2H4.2Z\"/><path d=\"M8.2 10.4h7.6\"/><path d=\"M8.2 12.9h4.8\"/></svg></span><em>广场</em></button></nav></div>";

